 "help.tips[0].examples[0].en": "device",
 "help.tips[0].examples[1].en": "screen",
 "help.tips[0].check.whyEn": "The plural note -e tells you to add -e: zwei Bildschirme.",
 "help.tips[0].en.text": "By now the plural matters as much as the article, because you write longer texts. Read the plural on the back of every noun card, and notice the pattern it follows.",
 "help.tips[0].en.title": "Nouns come with their plural",
 "help.tips[1].examples[0].en": "I'm downloading the file.",
 "help.tips[1].examples[1].en": "Switch the computer off!",
 "help.tips[1].check.whyEn": "hochladen is separable: lade at position 2, hoch at the end.",
 "help.tips[1].en.text": "einschalten, ausschalten, herunterladen, hochladen: in a main clause the prefix goes to the end. speichern and drucken stay in one piece.",
 "help.tips[1].en.title": "Tech verbs are mostly separable",
 "help.tips[2].examples[0].en": "She went home.",
 "help.tips[2].examples[1].en": "He came too late.",
 "help.tips[2].check.whyEn": "trinken – trank – getrunken: the vowel family i – a – u.",
 "help.tips[2].en.text": "gehen – ging – gegangen, kommen – kam – gekommen, sehen – sah – gesehen. Say the three forms as one chant; the middle one is the storytelling past.",
 "help.tips[2].en.title": "Strong past forms: learn the triple",
 "help.hookEn": "Technology, health, the environment and society: the words you need to argue a point, each noun with its article and plural.",
 "help.introEn": "Every word this module's exercises use, on one deck of flashcards: 379 cards, 159 of them nouns. The vocabulary of this module is work, study, media and opinions, and the verbs and connectors you need to argue a point, from the themes Technik & Medien, Gesundheit & Ernährung, Umwelt, Politik & Gesellschaft. Write the German, choose it from four options, or flip the card and rate yourself. A word you miss comes back later in the same run, and stays in your weak words until you get it right three times in a row.",
 "help.rememberEn[0]": "Never say a noun without its article, not even in your head.",
 "help.rememberEn[1]": "Miss a word? It comes back in the same run. Three correct answers in a row take it off the weak list.",
 "help.rememberEn[2]": "Verbs and adjectives have no article: type them as they stand, like \"speichern\"."
